# Provider Workspace Path Contract

Harness layout: `visible`.
All paths below are relative to the provider workspace selected by `agent-provider.json` `cwd`.
The provider workspace and harness root are the repository root; provider `cwd` is normally `.`.

Canonical harness paths:
- `SPEC.md` -> `SPEC.md`
- `feature_list.json` -> `feature_list.json`
- `progress.md` -> `progress.md`
- `QUALITY.md` -> `QUALITY.md`
